Jeroen, during my AEO walk-through in Venlo on 14 Oct I found a gap at the ga=
te. Visitors sign a paper sheet, nobody checks an ID, and there is no record =
of when the visitor badge comes back. The auditors will ask for exactly this =
on 9 Dec, so we have to fix it.

My proposal: a digital visitor log at reception with ID check, numbered badge=
s and a sign-out time, and the log kept for 12 months. Can your team own this=
 in Venlo? I would like it live by 6 November so we have enough time before t=
he mock audit on 24 Nov.

Thanks,
